---
description: Validate external JSON with Zod at API and type boundaries
globs: app/api/**/*.{ts,tsx},**/types.ts,**/*schema*
alwaysApply: false
---

# Zod at the boundary

- Parse untrusted or external JSON (fixtures, HTTP bodies, file reads) with Zod before domain use.
- Fail closed: invalid payloads return an error response or throw; do not silently coerce into partial domain objects.
- Colocate Zod schemas in a feature `schema.ts` or `schema/` module (use a directory when there are several schemas). Derive domain types with `z.infer` and keep non-schema types in `types.ts`.
- Prefer `z.infer<typeof schema>` for TypeScript types derived from schemas.
